vented your people from exploring beyond its boundaries. You were trained as a Mistalker, whose job was to explore the Mist and keep your home city of Valsonge safe. But...something has gone wrong. You begin your adventure by awaking outside of the Mist, suddenly thrust into the \u201creal\u201d world. This was not supposed to happen and the answers you seek will take the heart of an adventurer to discover.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259440/extras/dcf6458366da56795e63e6eedf9144ea.avif?t=1776131399\" width=616 height=96 /></span><br>Combat offers a turn-based and multiplayer combat system. As a Mistwalker, you can bring companions from the &quot;real&quot; world that you will recruit during your adventures. For the most challenging fights, you can group with other players to form a powerful combat team. The game offers five combat specializations that can be mixed in thousands of ways to create your unique fighting style. Adapt your combat strategy based on your opponents and cooperate with other players to dominate some of the fiercest creatures of the game.","developers":["Virtys"],"dlc":[1824190],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259440/header.jpg?t=1776131399","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2021 Virtys Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 64 bit or SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Anything qualifying as a GPU<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 MB available space<br></li><li